  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1602.14 Facility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1602.14 “Facility” means a location or system for the processing, treatment, or disposal of septage and septage solids, other than land application at a permitted site. Septage facilities include, but are not limited to septage lagoons, septage treatment facilities, and monofills. Facilities do not include septage holding tanks.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1600) #13944, eff 4-27-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq1600.html"
}
